      "delete_workflow_instance": false,
      "display_name": "Cisco Intersight - Format API failure",
      "description": "Formats an already-received Intersight failure response using native JSONPath, conditions and variable assignments. Preserves available HTTP 300-599 and conservative Code/Message details; raw response bodies are excluded from outputs. No target or API call is used. Internal caller context templates must be trusted exported literals.",
